{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人李旻芳、陳庭欣、何沛珈、甘詠寧、黎寬怡等爭奪競跑比賽「女神盃」，賽前最多藝人睇好陳庭欣，而其中阮浩棕被問到點解沒有睇好前緋聞女友何沛珈？</p><p>他笑言：「Oscar揀咗佢嘛。</p><p>」&lt;br/&gt;眾參賽者由錄影廠翹圈跑400米，結果由全程保持</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:17:44.102702+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T12:35:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T13:10:58.343015+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:10:58.343015+00:00","content_hash":"08b2ed1b8481ca9719e52aac13392a456c73e940ab08b1e856434ad76ecac502","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}